    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39225" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōvŏcātor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i>a challenger</i> to combat, <i><span class="en">Liv.
				Epit. 48 <i>med.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Just. 10,
				3, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">33, 4,
				12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Gell. 9, 13, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Flor. 2,
				17, 11</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., <i>a kind of gladiator</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cic.
				Sest. 64, 134</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell.
			2566</span></i> and 2568.</div>
